      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，她每天都在直面自己尚还弱小这个事实哦。\r\n她是个非常坚强的孩子……所以，没问题的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4e5428da4acb32a848ce9714c36426c06c134a3d1b6f0c616b09d620a466c76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
